{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"actor","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DeferredTask","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Success","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Success","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sendable","preciseIdentifier":"s:s8SendableP","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"DeferredTask","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" represents an asynchronous operation that is defined but does not start executing until it is explicitly started.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This allows precise control over when the asynchronous work begins, supporting scenarios where you want to set up an async operation ahead of time and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"trigger its execution at a chosen moment.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This type conforms to the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AsynchronousUnitOfWork"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol and is useful for wrapping async computations, network requests, or any other asynchronous operation"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that may throw an error and returns a value."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Example","anchor":"Example","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Basic usage with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"execute()"},{"type":"text","text":" to start and await the operation:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let deferred = DeferredTask<Int> {","    try await Task.sleep(nanoseconds: 1_000_000_000)","    return 42","}","let result = try await deferred.execute()","print(\"Result is \\(result)\")"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Accessing the result via the "},{"code":"result","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" property (an async property that awaits completion):"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let deferred = DeferredTask<Int> {","    10 * 5","}","let value = await deferred.result","print(\"Value is \\(value)\")"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Running the operation without awaiting its result immediately, via ","type":"text"},{"code":"run()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":":","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let deferred = DeferredTask<Int> {","    7 + 3","}","deferred.run()","\/\/ Later, you may await the result property or handle completion otherwise"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Subscribing to the task’s events using ","type":"text"},{"code":"subscribe()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":":","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let deferred = DeferredTask<String> {","    \"Hello, World!\"","}","let cancellable = deferred.subscribe { event in","    switch event {","    case .success(let value):","        print(\"Completed with value: \\(value)\")","    case .failure(let error):","        print(\"Failed with error: \\(error)\")","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Storing the subscription in a collection for lifecycle management:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["var cancellables = Set<AnyCancellable>()","let deferred = DeferredTask<Void> {","    print(\"Task executed\")","}","deferred.subscribe().store(in: &cancellables)"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Chaining with operators:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let result = try await DeferredTask { 21 }","    .map { $0 * 2 }","    .execute() \/\/ result is 42"],"type":"codeListing"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A deferred unit of asynchronous work that produces a result of type "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Success"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/DeferredTask"},"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"DeferredTask","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"DeferredTask","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"class","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"actor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"DeferredTask"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"DeferredTask.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Afluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Afluent\/DeferredTask.swift#L79"},"modules":[{"name":"Afluent"}],"roleHeading":"Class","externalID":"s:7Afluent12DeferredTaskC"},"topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/DeferredTask\/init(operation:)"]},{"title":"Instance Properties","generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/DeferredTask\/state"]},{"title":"Default Implementations","generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/DeferredTask\/Actor-Implementations","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/DeferredTask\/AsynchronousUnitOfWork-Implementations"]}],"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsynchronousUnitOfWork","doc:\/\/Afluent\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Afluent\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/Afluent\/ScA"],"type":"conformsTo"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/afluent\/deferredtask"]}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"references":{"doc://Afluent/documentation/Afluent/DeferredTask":{"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"actor","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"}